{
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_mission": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Code-generation agent bounds\n\nThis is a REPLAY workshop. Path A is the ledger you fill before Path B. The packet is not policy.\n\nA code-generation agent's authority must be bounded and evidenced. Identity claim is not authentication. Delegation is not authorization. Approval of a read is not approval of an install. A current credential is not a tool grant. No GitHub credential is used and no external repository is modified.\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    },
    "viz_debt": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Bounded record\n\n- claimed agent: acme-agent-coder-001\n- authentication: SIMULATED AUTHENTICATION RESULT\n- delegated operation: read_repository\n- approved operation: read_repository\n- approval authority: NOT PROVEN\n- credential: sim-cred-coder-001, status CURRENT\n- dependency name: example-lib, not installed\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    },
    "viz_request": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Request\n\nATTACK and RETEST submit `install_dependency`. The delegated and approved operation is `read_repository`.\n\nBASELINE submits `read_repository`.\n\nPull request and deploy stay NOT OPENED or NOT REQUESTED. Write the binding before Path B.\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    },
    "viz_pathb": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Path B — review\n\n- ATTACK: binding MISMATCH, ALLOW only as vulnerable_profile_fail_open:code_agent_scope_not_checked, simulated start, pull request NOT OPENED.\n- RETEST: binding MISMATCH, DENY operation_not_granted, do not infer execution.\n- BASELINE: binding MATCH, ALLOW tool_granted. A read grant is not authority to install, open a pull request, or deploy.\n\nResource impact is NOT PROVEN.\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    }
  },
